<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd JGB yield falls to 2.410 pct in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd JGB yield falls to 2.410 pct in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The benchmark 182nd 10-year Japanese government bond yield fell to a record low of 2.410 percent in early Tokyo trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The key yield had set a record low of 2.415 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It ended Tokyo trade at 2.435 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
